@startuml figure_9-6_notify_subscribers
' Chapter 9 - Simplified subscriber notification
' A change triggers a "notify subscribers" command; the sidecar pushes the alert
' out through the observability port.

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14

participant "Beth /\nMarketplace"     as MP
participant "Data Product/\nSidecar"  as SC
participant "Notification\nMechanism"     as OP
participant "Juliette /\nConsumer"    as JM

MP ->  SC : OOCS: notify subscribers\n(something changed)
SC ->  OP : Push alert
OP ->  JM : Change notification /\nEvent

@enduml
